.TH QUIPU-SIGNER-PROTECT-GRAPH 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-signer\-protect\-graph \- Permanently require attested writes for a graph
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu signer protect\-graph\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIIRI\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Permanently require attested writes for a graph
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIIRI\fR>

